-- TAB CHARACTER ------------------------------------------------ main.kl  K0103

I found a tab. Kalam code is indented with 4 spaces per level, so it looks the same in every editor.

2│ 	var sum = 0
   ^

Try: `    `

Help: Replace the tab with spaces (4 per level). `kalam fmt` does this for you; inside a string, write `\t`.

Learn more: kalam explain K0103
